{"id":"457585","name":"虫草花猪骨汤","author":"营养师奕可","authorId":"11458853","desc":"","cover":"images/457585/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虫草花","amount":"15克"},{"name":"猪骨","amount":"187克"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"3颗"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"0.5克"},{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"1克"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"3毫升"},{"name":"姜","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"根据食材的种类和重量，备好。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732842093911458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"取一奶锅，加水，放姜片，倒入料酒。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732843883811458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入洗净过的猪骨，焯下水，其目的是去除骨头里没有洗干净的血水。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732845648411458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"水烧开之后就会发现煮出了很多血沫，捞出猪骨后再洗净。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732847174311458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"将猪骨放入小炖锅。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732849279911458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入洗过的虫草花和水。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732852199211458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入鸡粉和盐。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732853831811458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上盖子，插电，炖半小时。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732855930811458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"再加入红枣片和枸杞，炖10分钟即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732857823711458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"好喝的虫草花猪骨汤就做好啦！","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/08/20190508155732859891311458853.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"1.虫草花有润肺、补肾、护肝、抗氧化、提高机体免疫力等功效。猪骨，含钙多，有利于骨骼的生长。两者搭配来煮汤，营养丰富、味道鲜美，是一款老少咸宜四季滋补的靓汤。\n2.建议下午4点就开始炖，这样才可以和晚餐的荞麦面一起食用，达到更好的减重效果！ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}